  "before": [],
  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "A site is a business location, and the record ties it to one planning cluster, one enterprise unit, one calendar and, through its address, one country. Under multisite a site cannot exist without its cluster, so the cluster and the enterprise unit are chosen from ones that already exist. Saving makes only the site: its warehouses, departments and settings by site are added afterwards, from its own tabs."
      }
